us="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YUAN, HONGYONG</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FAN WEICHENG</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>LIU BINGHAI</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>LIU SHENYOU</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SU GUOFENG</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WANG QINGAN</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YUAN HONGYONG</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FAN, WEICHENG</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>LIU, BINGHAI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>LIU, SHENYOU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SU, GUOFENG</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WANG, QINGAN</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YUAN, HONGYONG</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The invention refers to a method of detecting fire with light section  images to sense smoke. An infrared radiation array (1) and infrared cameras (2) are provided in monitoring area, the images of infrared light spot transmitted by infrared radiation array (1) are transformed into video signal by infrared cameras (2) and transmitted to video switch (3), the video switch sends the received video signal to computer (4) one by one, the computer processes the signal. If the fire is found, the computer controls alarm unit (5) by linkage to alarm.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de détection d'incendies sensible à la fumée à images interceptant la lumière. Un réseau infrarouge et une caméra infrarouge sont disposés dans la zone de surveillance de manière que les images infrarouges projetées par le réseau infrarouge (1) soient transformées en signaux vidéo qui sont à leur tour transmis à un commutateur (3) qui envoie les signaux vidéo reçus à un ordinateur (4) en vue de leur traitement. En cas de détection d'incendie, l'unité d'alerte (5) est pilotée par ordinateur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>